+# =============================================================================
+# SteadyInnovMod — "Claim Great Power Status" decision (2026-07-08, rev B)
+# Design: hk-config/roadmap/ROADMAP-gp-og-gate.md (user-reviewed D1-D5)
+# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
+# WHY: the GP bar = 5.0 x AVERAGE country prestige (00_country_ranks.txt), so a
+# prestige-hoarding player inflates the average and organic GPs drop out (roster
+# collapses to 2-3). This decision opts a CANDIDATE nation into the stdinnv_gp.1
+# feedback controller (events/stdinnv_gp_events.txt): ramp prestige while below GP
+# and the roster is deficient (fewer than 9 GPs), hold when converged, full
+# deactivate + re-arm if candidacy is lost.
+#
+# Candidacy is DYNAMIC (stdinnv_gp_candidate, the mod's single trigger file): no
+# hardcoded tags, so risers (JAP/KOR/BHT/IND) qualify too. Decision itself only
+# takeable AT PEACE (covers the civil-war ranking dip). Player may take it as well
+# (harmless while already a GP: the controller ramps nothing, boost stays 0).
+# One-shot while active via the stdinnv_gp_active flag; the controller clears the
+# flag on deactivation, which re-arms this decision automatically.
+# Tokens verified vs game files 2026-07-08: is_at_war = no (vanilla decisions);
+# scripted-trigger invocation `name = yes` (ai_triggers usage); rest master-vetted.
+# =============================================================================
+stdinnv_become_great_power = {
+
+	is_shown = {
+		stdinnv_gp_candidate = yes
+		NOT = { has_variable = stdinnv_gp_active }
+	}
+
+	possible = {
+		stdinnv_gp_candidate = yes   # repeated so requirements show in the tooltip
+		is_at_war = no
+	}
+
+	when_taken = {
+		set_variable = { name = stdinnv_gp_active value = yes }
+		trigger_event = { id = stdinnv_gp.1 }
+	}
+
+	# Every AI candidate takes it promptly; harmless while the roster is healthy
+	# (the controller's 9-GP cap keeps the pumps idle until the roster dips).
+	ai_chance = { value = 10000 }
+}
